From: =?UTF-8?q?Trung=20L=C3=AA?= <8@tle.id.au>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 00:42:05 +1100
Subject: [PATCH] Do not warn about catch, deprecated in OTP 29

OTP 29 deprecates the catch expression, which src/mozjs_nif.erl uses, and
warnings are errors.
---
 rebar.config | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/rebar.config b/rebar.config
index d4b1bde..ad14e7b 100644
--- a/rebar.config
+++ b/rebar.config
@@ -6,6 +6,7 @@
 
 {erl_opts, [
     warnings_as_errors,
+    nowarn_deprecated_catch,
     warn_export_vars,
     warn_unused_import
 ]}.
